{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"集論校勘說明","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"一.是書校歷二週．一譯校．二刻校。","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"二.譯校用西藏勝友等譯阿毗達磨集論對勘．校註略稱藏本。又用玄奘譯安慧糅","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"阿毗達磨雜集論參證．校註略稱釋論。","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"三.譯校凡有四例。（一）藏本章句歧異可資硏究者．皆註出曰．藏本雲雲。（二）藏本","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"譯義較暢可互發明者．皆註出曰．勘藏本意雲雲。（三）因對勘藏本而見奘譯未","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"愜者．皆註出曰．勘藏本雲雲．今譯雲雲。（四）釋論牒釋與今本參差者．皆註出曰．","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"釋論雲雲。","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"四.刻校用南宋刻爲底本．對校麗刻明刻．訂正文字．附註曰．原刻雲雲．依某刻雲雲。","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"五.校勘資料出處如次。","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"（一）西藏譯阿毗達磨集論．Chos-mn%on-pakun-lasbtus-pa.北京版．丹珠經","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_12","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"解部．li字函五一頁上至一四一頁下。","sortOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"（二）玄奘譯阿毗達磨雜集論．日本大正大藏經本。","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"（三）本書南宋刻麗刻明刻本．依據日本弘教書院縮刷正藏本及大正大藏","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_178_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_178","text":"經本校註。","sortOrder":16}],"overrides":{}}